    "16326856498e4250ca": {
      "type": "customer-reviews",
      "blocks": {
        "55f2a418-c25d-4b64-9a76-e50700013162": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/UGC-SnowPillowBedroom.png",
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>I never write this stuff… but I’m impressed by this company! It’s about time someone brought quality and custom decorating to people’s homes in an available, cost effective and FAST way! Bravo!</p>",
            "source": "Martha P",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "66f9b9d6-2053-4181-904b-1c75a58ecf6d": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/UGC-BlakeMossNursery.png",
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>The wallpaper was more beautiful than I could have anticipated. The colors are crisp and the design is so fun. I am so happy with our purchase.</p>",
            "source": "Julia N.",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "16326856498e4250ca-2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/UGC-JuliaBedroom-1.png",
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>Drapes are beautiful, fabric is heavy weight and quality. I had received an outrageous quote for drapes and looked for alternatives and found Pepper. I took a chance and I'm so glad I did! They are beautiful- better than I expected.</p>",
            "source": "Lauren E.",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "16326856498e4250ca-1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/UGC-Wallpaper-ThatcherMidnight-Okendo_1.jpg",
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>The quality of the wallpaper was extremely high! The detail in the print is absolutely amazing and brings any room to life!</p>",
            "source": "Taylor O.",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "1332fa63-5bf3-47d8-9e3c-f1ba68d3b6c9": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/UGC-PenelopeMossShower.png",
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>Incredible quality and a fast turnaround time. I reached out to Pepper Home for advice picking the perfect fabric and they nailed it!</p>",
            "source": "Michelle G.",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "3e1a3545-6909-4f85-875d-2def89cdfd65": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/UGC-WalnutCurtainBedroom.png",
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>I love our new curtains! It was so simple to order and came so quickly! I love the tools they give you to help order the correct size and length. Will definitely be ordering for other rooms soon!</p>",
            "source": "Miriam W.",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "16326856498e4250ca-0": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/FeaturedCollections-CURTAIN1.jpg",
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>Pepper Home not only offers beautiful high quality home accents, but also remarkable customer service. Will always use Pepper Home for our interior design projects.</p>",
            "source": "Marissa S.",
            "product": ""
          }
        }
      },
